 "about": {
  "text": "Many people initially find Paul Mescal “hot.” The BBC miniseries NORMAL PEOPLE (2020) certainly played a part in this—in it, alongside Daisy Edgar-Jones, he successfully conveyed the erotic tension from the novel by star Irish author Sally Rooney. This “first love” role irrevocably shaped the image of the now 30-year-old. On top of that came another hit with AFTERSUN (2022), which cast Mescal as an unhappy but loving and attractive father and earned him an Oscar nomination. …",
  "lang": "en",
  "venue": "Xenix",
  "url": "https://www.xenix.ch/programm/november-2026/paul-mescal",
  "translated": true
 },
